{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux创建可疑命名管道。对应需求：执行。官方：Suspicious Named Pipe Creation。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux创建可疑命名管道","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux创建可疑命名管道\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机或容器内执行代码\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":73,"rule_id":"8167c5ae-3310-439a-8a58-be60f55023d2","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"host.os.type:linux and event.category:process and event.type:start and event.action:(exec or ProcessRollup2 or start) and process.name:mkfifo and\nprocess.parent.name:(bash or csh or dash or fish or ksh or sh or tcsh or zsh) and\nprocess.args:((/dev/shm/* or /tmp/* or /var/tmp/*) and not (/*fifo* or /var/tmp/dracut* or /var/tmp/portage/* or /tmp/opencode_install*.trace))\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"name":"Execution","id":"TA0002","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"}]}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"name":"Command and Control","id":"TA0011","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"},"technique":[{"name":"Application Layer Protocol","id":"T1071","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/"}]}],"new_terms_fields":["host.id","process.command_line"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":6,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
